   "sourceHash": "501f0ded635c7b8c3e0bb483fe8529be49ae991f28955e3dbf1e3f77c198fad9",
   "text": "अगर मैं शुरुआती हूँ तो क्या होगा?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
